{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31320","headline":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 四丈夫同赋 一 · 李玖","name":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 四丈夫同赋 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟啼莺语思何穷，一世荣华一梦中。\n李固有冤藏蠹简，邓攸无子续清风。\n文章高韵传流水，丝管遗音托草虫。\n春月不知人事改，闲垂光影照洿宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李玖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}